{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"testStart"},["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"testStart":["^Es... geht nicht auf. ","#","^speaker: Hermbert ","/#","#","^visual: Hermbert ","/#","#","^layout: rightLayout","/#","\n","^Wo ein Tor ist ist auch eine Tür, wie mein Papa immer zu sagen pflegte! ","#","^speaker: Milbert ","/#","#","^visual: Milbert ","/#","#","^layout: leftLayout","/#","\n","^Bist du dir sicher dass das Sprichtwort so geht? ","#","^speaker: Hermbert ","/#","#","^visual: Hermbert ","/#","#","^layout: rightLayout","/#","\n","^Wenn sich eine Tür öffnet, schließt sich auch die nächste? ","#","^speaker: Milbert ","/#","#","^visual: Milbert ","/#","#","^layout: leftLayout","/#","\n","^Da steh ich nun, ich armer Tor Und bin so Klug wie als zuvor. ","#","^speaker: Hermbert ","/#","#","^visual: Hermbert ","/#","#","^layout: rightLayout","/#","\n","^Dumme gehen, kluge warten, Weise gehen in den Garten. ","#","^speaker: Milbert ","/#","#","^visual: Milbert ","/#","#","^layout: leftLayout","/#","\n","^Es ist ein Gewächshaus, Millie. ","#","^speaker: Hermbert ","/#","#","^visual: Hermbert ","/#","#","^layout: rightLayout","/#","\n","^Ich glaube auch nicht dass jemand in dir den Schlüssel versteckt hat Herm. ","#","^speaker: Milbert ","/#","#","^visual: Milbert ","/#","#","^layout: leftLayout","/#","\n","^Ich hoffe nicht! ","#","^speaker: Hermbert ","/#","#","^visual: Hermbert ","/#","#","^layout: rightLayout","/#","\n","^Ich geh mich mal umschauen. Ich bin gleich wieder da! ","#","^speaker: Milbert ","/#","#","^visual: Milbert ","/#","#","^layout: leftLayout","/#","\n","^Bitte bleib nicht zulange weg ... ","#","^speaker: Hermbert ","/#","#","^visual: Hermbert ","/#","#","^layout: rightLayout","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}